Package: AUCSimHerd
Title: A stochastic reindeer herd simulator
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Lars", "Ronnegard", , "lars.ronnegard@slu.se", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The package simulates the female part of a reindeer herd. The reindeer are individually simulated and both the calving probability and calf weight is allowed to be dependent on the mother's body weight. Selection on calf weights is assumed.
License: `use_gpl3_license()` 
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
